# Ad-hoc probe scripts (DOM/geometry/motion inspection during development).
# Everything under site/scripts is throwaway; nothing here is wired into npm scripts.
#
# This ignores the DIRECTORY, and git does not descend into an ignored directory —
# so a negation like `!scripts/keep-me.mjs` does NOT work here. A probe that has to
# survive (be tracked, be a CI gate) belongs in site/tools/, which is tracked.
scripts
